[23.172108, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Run \u001b[1mami --skill <name>\u001b[22m to pin a skill stance for the session.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > In the current empty directory, create a self-contained Python file named bug_demo.py using only \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mrelative paths and no network access; include a function with an intentional type/comparison bug, \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mthen inspect it, explain the cause, fix it, and run several representative examples to verify the \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mcorrected results. Keep the process concise and finish by printing a clear readable summary of the \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mverified outputs and overall PASS result, not a long real-time animation. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan list_dir(Contents of /tmp/ami-demo-ZD4ey2: (1 entries)) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan glob([2 files]) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #2\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI\u2019ll create one standalone script that demonstrates the faulty comparison, prints a concise\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kinspection and cause, uses the corrected implementation, and verifies several boundary/type cases\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kwith a final PASS summary.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m[Checkpoint 